--- !u!114 &69645479
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 69645477}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 74c47e3a0cf4baa409a657f200a9f294, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GJ.Game.ReadableNote
  text: 'DAY 9


    The boiler. The bolt runs on steam:

    water in the pot, the
    relief valve

    shut, my lighter under it. It boils

    slower than I can
    hold my breath.


    I''ve stopped counting the times.

    I leave these for
    whoever comes

    down next. I think it''s me.'
--- !u!23 &69645480
